# Godot
.godot/
*.translation
export_presets.cfg

# Local tools and downloads (Godot editor, plugin archives)
tools/

# Language models. The small tone model is in the repo through Git LFS.
# The chat model (gemma-3-4b-it-Q4_K_M.gguf, 2.5 GB) is over the 2 GB limit GitHub puts on
# one LFS file, so it is not; nor are the alternatives for the texting test. Download those.
models/*.gguf
!models/bge-small-en-v1.5-q8_0.gguf

# The NobodyWho plugin's Windows binary is in the repo through Git LFS (it is over the GitHub 100 MB limit).
# The Linux one is not; get it from the NobodyWho releases page.

# OpenStreetMap download kept by world/milan/build_map.py
world/milan/osm.json.gz
world/milan/osm_tiles/
addons/nobodywho/*.so
# Downloaded source data for the map (OpenStreetMap, Comune di Milano DBT, LiDAR, aerial photos): large, re-fetched by scripts
world/milan/sources/
